abstract: "Public research archive and thin integration layer for the Human Motor Intelligence programme: reproducibility infrastructure, the registered P6 C1 motor-imagery EEG-to-MyoSim replay (task success 0/60 for every decoder), its post-hoc validity audit (primary endpoint unreachable by design), and the registered C2 episode-level follow-up. Offline, non-clinical simulation evidence; not a medical device."
keywords:
  - biosignal processing
  - EEG
  - EMG
  - motor intent
  - cross-subject generalization
  - decoder accuracy
  - control utility
  - reproducibility
  - motor control
